18600 Verify_file:SUB Verify_file(Filename$,Type$,INTEGER Exist,Readable,Writable,Executable)
18601 !***** DON'T REMOVE THIS LINE *************************************
18602 !
18603 !  Type : Algorithm
18604 !  Name : VERIFY_FILE
18605 !  Vers : 1
18606 !  Desc : Description for this Algorithm spec.
18607 !  Date : 09/01/2000
18608 !  Time : 09:00:00
18609 !  User : specs
18610 !
18611 !***** DON'T REMOVE THIS LINE *************************************
18612 !
18613 !  Input Variables:
